      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cuk tha̱t mi ci pua̱a̱r",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ cäŋ kä wäl, kä wäl päthni, kɛ bäŋuan runi, cu ruac Kuɔth Nhial ben kä ɣä wëë i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gat ran, gɔ̱ri ciöt ca̱ŋ ɛ wa̱lɛ mɛ piny. Ɛn cäŋ ɛmɛ kɛ ɣöö ci kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm go̱l kɛ jɛn cäŋ ɛ wa̱lɛ mɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä lätni thok duëël ɛ ci kac raarɛ ruac cäätdä, ɛn ɣöö mɛmɛ ɛ min lar Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhialɛ wëë i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ, Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhial cɛ wee i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lia̱a̱ ciëk Yɛdh-ki-el",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ruac Kuɔth Nhial ben kä ɣä wëë i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gat ran, ciekdu bɛ rɔ pär kɛ lia̱a̱. Duundɛ ɣöö /cu pär kä /cu wiee, a cäŋɛ ni merku akɛ /ci pɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ lɔcdu jiɛth bitdä, /cu ram in ci li̱w par. A kumdu te wi̱i̱du, kä /cu jäl kɛ pa̱a̱tku baaŋ a thil wa̱a̱ri. /Cu nhiamdu kum, kä /cu cam ni mi̱th nɛɛni tin la pär.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ, ɣän cua̱ ruac kɛ naath kɛ runwaŋ, kä kɛ thiaŋ cu ciekdä li̱w. Kä kɛ runwaŋdɛ min dɔ̱diɛn cua̱ la̱t ce̱tnikɛ mëë ca la̱r ɣä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu naath ɣä thiec wäkɛ i̱, “Ji̱n /cikɔ bi la̱r mɔ lot ti̱ti̱ jɛ mɔ kɛ kui̱da, mɔ lätdi nɔmɔ ɔ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn, ɣän cua̱ kɛ la̱r ɣöö ci ruac Kuɔth Nhial ben kä ɣä, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ɛn ɣöö bä ruac kɛ thok duëël I-thɛ-rɛl, ɛn ɣöö mɛmɛ ɛ ruac Kua̱r ni Kuoth Nhial wëë i̱, “Ɣän bä luaakdä ya̱r, min la liak bumädun, kä gɔaa nëndɛ kä yɛ, kä nhɔk yɛnɛ kɛ lo̱ckun. Kä ba dhɔɔlkun kɛnɛ nyieekun tin cia ba̱ny jɔk näk ko̱o̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi yɛn ɛ la̱t ce̱tnikɛ min cä la̱t. /Ci yɛn nhiamdun bi kum kä /ci yɛn mi̱eth nɛɛni tin la pär bi cam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi kuɔ̱mni wuɔ̱thnikun te ni thi̱n, kä bi wa̱a̱rikun te ciöknikun. /Cuarɛ pär kä /cuarɛ wiee, duundɛ ɣöö bia thuuk kɛ kui̱ dueerikun, kä bi ramɔ ramɔ par. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ, bi Yɛdh-ki-el a nyuuth kä yɛ, bia jɛ la̱t ce̱tnikɛ min cɛ pay la̱t. Mi wä mɛmɛ wä cop, ɛ jɛn bi yɛn ɛ cu ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö ɛ ɣän Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhial.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ruac Kuɔth Nhial ben kä ɣä wëë i̱, “Gat ran, ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ, cäŋ in bä naŋ ni luaakdiɛn in bum bum kä kɛ, ɛn tɛ̈th lɔaacdiɛn kä buɔ̱mdiɛn, ɛn min gɔaa nëndɛ kä kɛ, kä nhɔk kɛn ɛ kɛ lo̱ckiɛn, amäni dhɔɔlkiɛn kɛnɛ nyieekiɛn bä, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ, bi ram mi ci kään ben kä ji̱ bɛ ji̱ ben la̱r thuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ bi thokdu te ɣo̱o̱ŋä kɛ ram in ci kään, kä bi ruac kɛ jɛ, /ci biɛt bilɛ nyɔk. Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ, bi ji̱n a nyuuth kä kɛ, kä bikɛn ɛ cu ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö ɛ ɣän Kuoth Nhial.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
